meta {
  name: Receipt (PDF)
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/MF-7QK4ZP2A/receipt
}

headers {
  Accept: application/pdf
}

docs {
  The one endpoint that does not answer in the JSON envelope. A receipt is a
  document somebody saves, forwards to an employer or takes to a shop counter,
  and wrapping the bytes in JSON would make it none of those.
}
